{"answer_text":"A shared inbox is often enough for small support teams before a full help desk. The best-rated: [1]\n\n- **Brightdesk**: Strong reporting and automations, though the interface feels dated. [2]\n- **Calmline**: A calm, fast shared inbox with collision detection and CRM sidebars. [3]\n- **Orbitly**: Works as a lightweight request queue for small teams. [4]\n\nIn short, Brightdesk is the strongest fit for most teams; Calmline is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50f1-721c-bb2d-35b736dae7fe","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:55.850Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["best shared inbox support team","shared inbox vs help desk"],"latency_ms":4430,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[105,115],[364,374]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[195,203]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889e8624eae8","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Orbitly","name_text":"Orbitly","offsets":[[284,291]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."}],"model":"perplexity/sonar","prompt_id":"01a1f315-4dcf-76a1-bfe0-6a96ebe4716c","prompt_text":"Best shared